Alias[UNI_MINIMAL_VALUE_LEFT]:%RED%\%ORANGE%\\  %GOLD%>  %WHITE%•
Alias[UNI_MINIMAL_VALUE_RIGHT]:%WHITE%•  %GOLD%<  %ORANGE%/%ORANGE%/%RED%/%GOLD%

